Hello <%= @reader.name %>,

<% if @overdue -%>
"<%= @book.title %>" by <%= @book.author %> (serial number <%= @book.serial_number %>) was due back on <%= l(@borrowing.due_on, format: :long) %>. Please return it to the library as soon as possible.
<% else -%>
"<%= @book.title %>" by <%= @book.author %> (serial number <%= @book.serial_number %>) is due back today, <%= l(@borrowing.due_on, format: :long) %>. Please return it to the library.
<% end -%>

Thank you,
Your library
